00:01:06.050 --> 00:01:06.883
Hm.

00:01:06.883 --> 00:01:09.180
- I'll let my body speak
for itself on this one.

00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:13.044
- Oh, I can't skip because I can't choose.

00:01:13.044 --> 00:01:13.884
